g", "id": "2971148396282197", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974549_374619903264023_7889663886901641216_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8FKLvkSr6BoQ7kNvwFIvo6S&_nc_oc=Ado--b8o_C8LBNxYIYIOu5jic4cbFsng-RDs7pPN1-wvGSwwOSLnmlsjdqbtWWFne0E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGwvQ1Z_HE2-JrKU_2NJgB-UvcQmc58SBAe9K2MJdUohw&oe=6A7DCB22"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "/tmp/ZzBak8", "id": "2452381391650374", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982685_2452381394983707_8297693717121204224_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cIhtFHt92v4Q7kNvwEYerza&_nc_oc=Adr9PJPU2Mc3rXRWKQv9n-Mk4cLEJQ4Pd0JZB6_owUzr3YE42sY10rbK30KAZ8xVg8M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEJUfYFAAAws64ebxwOkXDeVUuxzQ9a-bPkaRP2V6506Q&oe=6A7DAF55"}, "display_name": "Sling TV", "keywords": ["TV", "sports", "shows", "television", "drama"], "long_description": "Sling TV is Live TV, Only Better. The #1 Live TV Streaming Service that lets you personalize your channel lineup and save. \nStart with the service best for you, then pick Extras in your favorite genres: Sports, Comedy, Kids, News, Movies, Lifestyle, Spanish, & more. Change your service online anytime.\n\nOver 100 live channels available to stream instantly on all of your favorite devices. Watch your favorite live sports like the NFL & college football, hit TV shows like Fear the Walking Dead, Better Call Saul, SportsCenter, plus 10,000+ hours of on-demand tv shows and movies.\n\nWith Sling TV you can get both TV and Cloud DVR on your terms - add it when you want and choose when you watch, for just $5\n\nThis is TV on your terms. No paying for useless channels, no long-term contracts, no hidden fees, easy online cancellation.\n\nThe Sling Orange service offers 30 channels for just $25/mo \u2013 including ESPN, Disney Channel, AMC, TNT, TBS, CNN, A&E, History, and many more.",